  abilityId: 2860888
  abilityName: Silent Solipsis
  abilityDesc: 34 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts all elemental damage for 4 turns, boosts critical damage for 4 turns,
    spark damage fills BB gauge for 4 turns, activates BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns
    & raises allies from KO
